# AI dev artifacts — never ship to production (MEH-449)
# Vercel's Root Directory is frontend/, so repo-root artifacts are already
# structurally out of reach; this file closes Gap 1 — a forbidden file
# accidentally copied INTO frontend/ must never be uploaded to Vercel.
# Canonical pattern list: ../.claude/hooks/check-artifact-location.sh
# Explicit names only — no *.md blanket glob (README.md must stay shippable).
# .gitignore syntax: a bare name matches at every directory level.
.aider.conf.yml
.claude/
.cursor/
AGENTS.md
CHANGELOG.md
CLAUDE.local.md
CLAUDE.md
HANDOFF.md
ROADMAP.md
docs/DEPLOYMENT.md
docs/MANUAL_TESTING.md
docs/MIGRATIONS.md
docs/SECURITY.md
